(function(){var h="<div class='bp-zone'> <svg class='drafting-mark north' viewBox='0 0 74 96' fill='none' stroke='#F4F4F4' stroke-width='1.4' aria-hidden='true'> <circle cx='37' cy='52' r='30'/><circle cx='37' cy='52' r='24' stroke-width='.8'/> <path d='M37 18 L46 52 L37 46 L28 52 Z' fill='#F4F4F4' fill-opacity='.85'/><path d='M37 86 L46 52 L37 58 L28 52 Z'/> <text x='37' y='12' fill='#F4F4F4' stroke='none' font-family='Architects Daughter, cursive' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle'>N</text> </svg> <section class='framework bp' id='framework'> <svg class='plan-drawing' style='display:none' viewBox='0 0 520 420' fill='none' stroke='#F4F4F4' stroke-width='2' aria-hidden='true'> <rect x='20' y='20' width='480' height='380'/> <rect x='28' y='28' width='464' height='364' stroke-width='1'/> <path d='M260 28 V180 M260 240 V392 M28 210 H180 M240 210 H492'/> <path d='M260 180 A60 60 0 0 1 320 240' stroke-width='1'/> <path d='M180 210 A60 60 0 0 0 240 150' stroke-width='1'/> <path d='M100 392 V404 M200 392 V404 M100 410 H200' stroke-width='1'/> <path d='M380 20 V8 M492 20 V8 M380 4 H492' stroke-width='1'/> <rect x='320' y='270' width='120' height='70' stroke-width='1'/> <circle cx='140' cy='110' r='34' stroke-width='1'/> </svg> <div class='wrap'> <div class='reveal'> <div class='label'>02 &middot; The framework</div> <h2>How the rebuild works</h2> <p class='lede'>Here's why the other work didn't stick. It went after the pattern: the overworking, the holding back, the people-pleasing. But the pattern isn't the problem. It's doing a job for an old identity, the version of you that needed it to feel safe. Fix the pattern and that identity builds it right back. So Wreck the Room goes in order, and the order is the point. Skip a step and the old room comes back.</p> <p class='lede' style='margin-top:14px'>This isn't therapy, and you don't relive your childhood. You look at the old room just long enough to stop living in it. And you design the new room before anything comes down, so you choose what stays.</p> </div> <div class='scrolly'> <div class='steps'> <div class='step' data-step='1'><article class='phase sheet-card'><span class='tick tl'></span><span class='tick br'></span> <svg class='ph-ic' viewBox='0 0 64 64' aria-hidden='true'><rect x='6' y='10' width='40' height='34' class='d'/><path d='M6 27h18M24 10v34' class='d'/><circle cx='38' cy='34' r='13'/><path d='M47 43l12 12'/></svg> <div class='num'>Phase 01</div> <h3>Wreck-ognize It</h3> <div class='verb'>see it</div> <ol><li>Reveal the room</li><li>Name the identity</li><li>Expose the lie</li><li>Design the new room</li></ol> <p>You can't change what you can't see. You name the identity you've been living as, where it came from and what it's costing you. Then you design what replaces it, on paper, before anything comes down.</p> </article></div> <div class='step' data-step='2'><article class='phase sheet-card'><span class='tick tl'></span><span class='tick br'></span> <svg class='ph-ic' viewBox='0 0 64 64' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M10 56L40 26'/><path d='M33 10l21 21-9 9-21-21z'/><path d='M8 30l6 2M12 22l5 5M20 16l2 6' class='d'/></svg> <div class='num'>Phase 02</div> <h3>Wreck It</h3> <div class='verb'>wreck it</div> <ol><li>Disrupt the cycle</li><li>Dismantle the role</li><li>Reclaim your power</li></ol> <p>This is where other work stops. Instead of managing the pattern, you take apart the role behind it, so there's nothing left for it to protect. This isn't about willpower. Willpower was never going to beat something built to keep you safe.</p> </article></div> <div class='step' data-step='3'><article class='phase sheet-card'><span class='tick tl'></span><span class='tick br'></span> <svg class='ph-ic' viewBox='0 0 64 64' aria-hidden='true'><circle cx='32' cy='9' r='4'/><path d='M30 12L14 56M34 12l16 44'/><path d='M19 42a24 24 0 0 0 26 0' class='d'/><path d='M6 58h52' class='d'/></svg> <div class='num'>Phase 03</div> <h3>Wrock It</h3> <div class='verb'>rebuild it</div> <ol><li>Rebuild with intention</li><li>Activate the architect</li><li>Anchor the new identity</li></ol> <p>You rebuild around what you want now: your values, your standards, your calendar and your daily habits. Then you lock it in, so the new you holds on a busy Tuesday, not just on a good day.</p> </article></div> </div> <div class='fig'><div class='story-sheet'><div class='sheet-cap'><span>Section B-B</span><span>The rebuild</span></div><div class='story-fig'><svg class='story-svg' viewBox='40 108 520 372' role='img' aria-label='Sketch of the old room being taken apart and a new, taller room being built'> <g><g class='grnd'><path class='draw' pathLength='1' d='M50 430 H550'/> <path class='hatch' d='M60 430 l-10 12 M74 430 l-10 12 M88 430 l-10 12 M102 430 l-10 12 M116 430 l-10 12 M130 430 l-10 12 M144 430 l-10 12 M158 430 l-10 12 M172 430 l-10 12 M186 430 l-10 12 M200 430 l-10 12 M214 430 l-10 12 M228 430 l-10 12 M242 430 l-10 12 M256 430 l-10 12 M270 430 l-10 12 M284 430 l-10 12 M298 430 l-10 12 M312 430 l-10 12 M326 430 l-10 12 M340 430 l-10 12 M354 430 l-10 12 M368 430 l-10 12 M382 430 l-10 12 M396 430 l-10 12 M410 430 l-10 12 M424 430 l-10 12 M438 430 l-10 12 M452 430 l-10 12 M466 430 l-10 12 M480 430 l-10 12 M494 430 l-10 12 M508 430 l-10 12 M522 430 l-10 12 M536 430 l-10 12 M550 430 l-10 12'/></g></g> <g class='old'> <rect class='brick old' x='170' y='414' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:0ms;--dx:12px;--dy:10px;--r:21deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='200' y='414' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:45ms;--dx:-58px;--dy:11px;--r:57deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='170' y='398' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:90ms;--dx:-46px;--dy:23px;--r:69deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='185' y='398' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:135ms;--dx:-56px;--dy:20px;--r:-26deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='215' y='398' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:180ms;--dx:-61px;--dy:27px;--r:31deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='170' y='382' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:225ms;--dx:37px;--dy:43px;--r:-19deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='200' y='382' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:270ms;--dx:-47px;--dy:36px;--r:28deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='170' y='366' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:315ms;--dx:-55px;--dy:51px;--r:-49deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='185' y='366' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:360ms;--dx:-13px;--dy:50px;--r:80deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='215' y='366' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:405ms;--dx:-55px;--dy:51px;--r:69deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='170' y='350' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:450ms;--dx:31px;--dy:76px;--r:-24deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='200' y='350' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:495ms;--dx:-59px;--dy:68px;--r:-46deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='170' y='334' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:540ms;--dx:4px;--dy:86px;--r:-44deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='185' y='334' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:585ms;--dx:68px;--dy:91px;--r:66deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='215' y='334' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:630ms;--dx:8px;--dy:84px;--r:-34deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='170' y='318' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:675ms;--dx:-44px;--dy:99px;--r:66deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='200' y='318' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:720ms;--dx:-22px;--dy:103px;--r:-56deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='170' y='302' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:765ms;--dx:70px;--dy:123px;--r:64deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='185' y='302' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:810ms;--dx:-55px;--dy:115px;--r:-28deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='215' y='302' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:855ms;--dx:57px;--dy:114px;--r:56deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='370' y='414' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:0ms;--dx:39px;--dy:7px;--r:39deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='400' y='414' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:45ms;--dx:46px;--dy:7px;--r:-4deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='370' y='398' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:90ms;--dx:-7px;--dy:26px;--r:-18deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='385' y='398' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:135ms;--dx:-50px;--dy:19px;--r:-4deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='415' y='398' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:180ms;--dx:64px;--dy:21px;--r:7deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='370' y='382' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:225ms;--dx:44px;--dy:40px;--r:75deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='400' y='382' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:270ms;--dx:-52px;--dy:43px;--r:51deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='370' y='366' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:315ms;--dx:37px;--dy:58px;--r:7deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='385' y='366' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:360ms;--dx:-32px;--dy:53px;--r:27deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='415' y='366' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:405ms;--dx:-60px;--dy:50px;--r:-61deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='370' y='350' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:450ms;--dx:10px;--dy:71px;--r:9deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='400' y='350' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:495ms;--dx:57px;--dy:67px;--r:36deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='370' y='334' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:540ms;--dx:-53px;--dy:91px;--r:-11deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='385' y='334' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:585ms;--dx:51px;--dy:82px;--r:-64deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='415' y='334' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:630ms;--dx:-55px;--dy:88px;--r:67deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='370' y='318' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:675ms;--dx:44px;--dy:104px;--r:18deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='400' y='318' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:720ms;--dx:18px;--dy:108px;--r:38deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='370' y='302' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:765ms;--dx:20px;--dy:122px;--r:76deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='385' y='302' width='30' height='16' style='transition-delay:810ms;--dx:-41px;--dy:117px;--r:-65deg'/> <rect class='brick old' x='415' y='302' width='15' height='16' style='transition-delay:855ms;--dx:-15px;--dy:120px;--r:-47deg'/> <rect x='160' y='286' width='280' height='16' class='slab old-slab'/> </g> <g class='off-2'><g class='adult-stoop'> <circle cx='322' cy='318' r='13' class='draw' pathLength='1'/> <path class='draw' pathLength='1' d='M314 329 Q300 344 298 384 M306 342 L322 372 M306 342 L290 372 M298 384 L286 430 M298 384 L314 430'/> </g></g> <g class='on-1 off-2'> <circle cx='300' cy='340' r='118' class='lens'/><path class='lens' d='M384 424 L430 470'/> <text x='60' y='132' class='hand'>existing room (inherited)</text> <path class='lead' d='M60 140 H150 L196 300'/><circle cx='196' cy='300' r='3' class='dotw'/> </g> <g class='on-2 off-3'><text x='60' y='132' class='hand red'>demo: walls you don't need</text></g> <g class='on-2'><g class='adult-tall'> <circle cx='300' cy='238' r='15' class='draw' pathLength='1'/> <path class='draw' pathLength='1' d='M300 253 V338 M300 274 L278 306 M300 274 L326 296 M300 338 L286 430 M300 338 L314 430'/> <rect class='draw' pathLength='1' x='324' y='282' width='34' height='9' rx='4' transform='rotate(-25 341 286)'/> </g></g> <g class='on-3 new'> <path class='draw' pathLength='1' d='M110 430 V150 H490 V430'/> <path class='draw' pathLength='1' d='M122 430 V162 H478 V430'/> <path class='draw' pathLength='1' d='M110 220 H122 M110 290 H122 M478 340 H490'/> <path class='draw' pathLength='1' d='M110 230 H122 V280 H110 M116 230 V280'/> <path class='draw' pathLength='1' d='M490 340 V430 M478 340 A90 90 0 0 0 478 430' style='stroke-dasharray:1'/> <g class='dimv'><path d='M520 430 V150 M514 430 H526 M514 150 H526'/><text x='534' y='300' class='hand' transform='rotate(90 534 300)'>room to grow</text></g> <text x='96' y='200' class='hand r'>window</text><text x='504' y='330' class='hand'>door</text> <text x='300' y='140' class='hand c'>drawn by: you</text> </g> </svg></div></div></div> </div> <div class='xform'> <p class='xform-head reveal'>Same room. Three stages.</p> <div class='xform-row'> <figure class='xform-card reveal'><img src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mayadex853/Dashboards/0d5fcabb6e63eccab9300613af510942bcd31e21/offer/blueprint/assets/room-see.webp' alt='Wireframe drawing of a small, cramped room' loading='lazy' width='420' height='600'> <figcaption><span class='tag'>Wreck-ognize It</span><span class='hand'>The room you were handed, drawn line by line.</span></figcaption></figure> <span class='xform-arrow' aria-hidden='true'>&rarr;</span> <figure class='xform-card reveal'><img src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mayadex853/Dashboards/0d5fcabb6e63eccab9300613af510942bcd31e21/offer/blueprint/assets/room-wreck.webp' alt='Exploded drawing of the same room, walls and furniture pulled apart' loading='lazy' width='420' height='600'> <figcaption><span class='tag'>Wreck It</span><span class='hand'>Every piece taken apart, on purpose.</span></figcaption></figure> <span class='xform-arrow' aria-hidden='true'>&rarr;</span> <figure class='xform-card reveal'><img src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mayadex853/Dashboards/0d5fcabb6e63eccab9300613af510942bcd31e21/offer/blueprint/assets/room-rebuild.webp' alt='The same room rebuilt: bigger window, open doorway, clear path' loading='lazy' width='420' height='600'> <figcaption><span class='tag'>Wrock It</span><span class='hand'>Same space, your design, a clear way forward.</span></figcaption></figure> </div> <p class='xform-swipe' aria-hidden='true'>swipe &rarr;</p> </div> </div> </section> <section class='shifts bp' id='shifts'> <div class='wrap'> <div class='reveal'> <div class='label'>03 &middot; What changes</div> <h2>Three big changes. Where they meet, you become an Activated Architect.</h2> <p class='lede'>If you only fix one of these, the other two pull you back. A new you with no confidence behind it goes nowhere. Confidence without a plan burns out. A plan built on the old you just gets you more of the same. Real change happens when all three line up.</p> </div> <figure class='venn reveal' aria-label='Venn diagram: Rebuilt Identity, Reclaimed Power and Designed Life overlap at Activated Architect'> <svg viewBox='0 0 640 560' role='img'> <g class='construct'> <path class='dl' pathLength='1' d='M320 200 L228 360 L412 360 Z'/> <path class='dl' pathLength='1' d='M412 360 L559 296'/> <g class='cross'><path d='M312 200h16M320 192v16'/><path d='M220 360h16M228 352v16'/><path d='M404 360h16M412 352v16'/></g> </g> <circle class='c c-id' pathLength='1' cx='320' cy='200' r='160'/> <circle class='c c-life' pathLength='1' cx='228' cy='360' r='160'/> <circle class='c c-power' pathLength='1' cx='412' cy='360' r='160'/> <text class='t-hand' x='500' y='318' transform='rotate(-23 500 318)'>R = 160</text> <text class='t-main' x='320' y='102'>Rebuilt Identity</text> <text class='t-sub' x='320' y='128'>Inherited &#8594; Chosen</text> <text class='t-main' x='160' y='430'>Designed Life</text> <text class='t-sub' x='160' y='456'>Reactive &#8594; Proactive</text> <text class='t-main' x='480' y='430'>Reclaimed Power</text> <text class='t-sub' x='480' y='456'>Suppressed &#8594; Unleashed</text> <text class='t-ov' x='236' y='262'>Magnetic</text><text class='t-ov' x='236' y='280'>Positioning</text> <text class='t-ov' x='404' y='262'>Authentic</text><text class='t-ov' x='404' y='280'>Agency</text> <text class='t-ov' x='320' y='414'>Absolute</text><text class='t-ov' x='320' y='432'>Control</text> <text class='t-core' x='320' y='306'>Activated</text><text class='t-core' x='320' y='334'>Architect</text> </svg> </figure> <article class='evo reveal'> <div class='evo-copy'> <div class='sheet-no'>Sheet E-01 &middot; Wreck-ognize It</div> <h3>Rebuilt Identity</h3> <div class='fromto'><s>Inherited</s> <span>&#8594;</span> <b>Chosen</b></div> <dl class='evo-why'> <dt>What it's costing you</dt><dd>You're running your business as someone you never chose to be. The roles you took on to stay safe and liked are still making your decisions. So every win feels like it belongs to someone else.</dd> <dt>Who you become</dt><dd>Someone who makes choices based on who they decided to be. You know what you want and why, and you stop living by other people's idea of &ldquo;enough.&rdquo;</dd> <dt>Why Wreck the Room works</dt><dd>Other work tries to change your choices. But your choices come from who you think you are. So first you write down the old you and name it. Then you design the new you, before anything gets torn down.</dd> </dl> </div> <svg class='evo-art' viewBox='0 0 440 250' aria-hidden='true'> <g class='before'> <rect pathLength='1' x='44' y='54' width='120' height='120' class='dash'/> <rect pathLength='1' x='36' y='46' width='120' height='120' class='dash'/> <rect pathLength='1' x='28' y='38' width='120' height='120'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M28 98 H100 M100 38 V158'/> <text class='t-note' x='88' y='194'>copy of a copy</text> </g> <g class='demo'><path pathLength='1' d='M18 30 L176 182'/><path pathLength='1' d='M176 30 L18 182'/><text class='t-demo' x='97' y='24'>DEMO</text></g> <g class='arrow'><path pathLength='1' d='M196 110 H246'/><path pathLength='1' d='M236 100 L248 110 L236 120'/></g> <g class='after'> <path pathLength='1' d='M268 36 H412 V176 H268 Z'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M268 106 H318 M352 106 H412 M340 36 V80'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M318 106 A34 34 0 0 1 352 106'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M412 54 V92 M407 54 V92'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M286 216 H394'/> <text class='t-note' x='340' y='210'>drawn by: you</text> </g> <text class='t-label' x='88' y='240'>Inherited</text> <text class='t-label' x='340' y='240'>Chosen</text> </svg> </article> <article class='evo flip reveal'> <div class='evo-copy'> <div class='sheet-no'>Sheet E-02 &middot; Wreck It</div> <h3>Reclaimed Power</h3> <div class='fromto'><s>Suppressed</s> <span>&#8594;</span> <b>Unleashed</b></div> <dl class='evo-why'> <dt>What it's costing you</dt><dd>You've learned to hold back. Softer in meetings. Smaller in your pitch. Quiet about what you really think. It keeps you successful, and it keeps you stuck at the same time.</dd> <dt>Who you become</dt><dd>The person who says what they really think and leads at full strength, without asking for permission first.</dd> <dt>Why Wreck the Room works</dt><dd>If you've done therapy or coaching and still hit the same wall, here's why. That pattern was built to protect you, so willpower can't beat it. Wreck It goes after the reason the pattern exists, so it stops running your life.</dd> </dl> </div> <svg class='evo-art' viewBox='0 0 440 250' aria-hidden='true'> <g class='before'> <path pathLength='1' d='M20 196 H180'/> <rect pathLength='1' x='40' y='104' width='120' height='92'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M60 104 V196 M80 104 V196 M120 104 V196 M140 104 V196'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M40 120 H160'/> <circle pathLength='1' cx='100' cy='150' r='8'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M100 158 Q94 168 96 182 M96 182 L112 184 L108 196 M98 166 L110 178 L112 184'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M70 80 V96 M64 90 L70 98 L76 90 M130 80 V96 M124 90 L130 98 L136 90'/> <text class='t-note' x='100' y='70'>kept small</text> </g> <g class='demo'><path pathLength='1' d='M14 40 L186 206'/><path pathLength='1' d='M186 40 L14 206'/><text class='t-demo' x='100' y='30'>DEMO</text></g> <g class='arrow'><path pathLength='1' d='M200 130 H250'/><path pathLength='1' d='M240 120 L252 130 L240 140'/></g> <g class='after'> <path pathLength='1' d='M262 196 H422'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M348 106 Q372 134 390 172 L368 162 L364 178 L348 118'/> <circle pathLength='1' cx='342' cy='92' r='10'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M342 102 V148 M342 148 L322 196 M342 148 L362 196'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M342 112 L326 126 L336 138'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M342 110 L362 86 L370 66'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M270 196 L278 184 L288 196 M396 196 L404 182 L416 190 L414 196'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M282 80 L292 74 L296 84 Z M404 92 L414 90 L412 100 Z M290 118 L298 116 L296 124 Z'/> <path class='route' pathLength='1' d='M368 72 L388 34 M373.4 29.2 L380 16.8 L406.6 30.8 L400 43.2 Z'/> <path class='route' pathLength='1' d='M414 18 L428 10 M418 36 L432 36 M366 14 L360 2'/> <text class='t-note' x='300' y='40'>full strength</text> </g> <text class='t-label' x='100' y='240'>Suppressed</text> <text class='t-label' x='342' y='240'>Unleashed</text> </svg> </article> <article class='evo reveal'> <div class='evo-copy'> <div class='sheet-no'>Sheet E-03 &middot; Wrock It</div> <h3>Designed Life</h3> <div class='fromto'><s>Reactive</s> <span>&#8594;</span> <b>Proactive</b></div> <dl class='evo-why'> <dt>What it's costing you</dt><dd>Your calendar belongs to everyone else. You built the business to be free, and now you spend your days reacting: other people's emergencies, other people's priorities, the next fire.</dd> <dt>Who you become</dt><dd>Someone who lives by their own plan. How you spend your time finally matches what you care about, and you can feel it on a normal Tuesday.</dd> <dt>Why Wreck the Room works</dt><dd>Productivity hacks sit on top of the old you, so they wear off. Wrock It rebuilds the foundation, so the change holds even when life gets busy.</dd> </dl> </div> <svg class='evo-art' viewBox='0 0 440 250' aria-hidden='true'> <g class='before'> <rect pathLength='1' x='30' y='40' width='140' height='140'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M60 40 A26 26 0 0 0 86 66 M86 40 V66'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M170 74 A26 26 0 0 0 144 100 M170 100 H144'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M120 180 A26 26 0 0 0 94 154 M94 180 V154'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M30 130 A26 26 0 0 0 56 104 M30 104 H56'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M10 70 L40 84 M190 150 L160 138 M100 10 L104 40 M14 170 L40 160'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M70 120 L84 96 L98 132 L112 104 L126 126'/> <text class='t-note' x='100' y='206'>everything comes at you</text> </g> <g class='demo'><path pathLength='1' d='M20 32 L180 190'/><path pathLength='1' d='M180 32 L20 190'/><text class='t-demo' x='100' y='24'>DEMO</text></g> <g class='arrow'><path pathLength='1' d='M196 110 H246'/><path pathLength='1' d='M236 100 L248 110 L236 120'/></g> <g class='after'> <path pathLength='1' d='M266 132 V40 H416 V132 M416 160 V180 H266 V160'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M260 132 H272 M260 160 H272 M410 132 H422 M410 160 H422'/> <path pathLength='1' d='M266 100 H330 M330 40 V100 M370 100 H416'/> <path pathLength='1' class='route' d='M252 146 H434'/> <path pathLength='1' class='route' d='M424 137 L436 146 L424 155'/> <text class='t-note' x='432' y='178'>exit</text> <text class='t-note' x='341' y='206'>a route you chose</text> </g> <text class='t-label' x='100' y='240'>Reactive</text> <text class='t-label' x='341' y='240'>Proactive</text> </svg> </article> </div> </section> <section class='architects bp' id='architects'> <div class='wrap'> <div class='arch-copy reveal'> <div class='label'>04 &middot; The Architects</div> <h2>Who you become on the other side</h2> <div class='occupant'><s>Occupant</s><span class='to'>&rarr;</span><b>Activated Architect</b></div> <p class='lede'>Picture a normal Tuesday a year from now. You make the hard call before lunch and don't replay it all afternoon. You say what you really think in the meeting. Your calendar has opened up, and the open time is there because you put it there. Your income is growing exponentially, because once the old room comes down, you can finally see the simplifications and growth levers it was hiding from you. You're home for dinner, and you're actually there. The success you already had finally feels like yours. That's an Activated Architect.</p> <p style='color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:18px'>And you don't do this alone. You'll be one of the Architects, our private community of people doing the same work and tearing down the same walls. You'll also have the Wrecking Crew beside you: our founding members, the first to go through the program and the first to see its enormous effect and lasting change for themselves.</p> </div> <figure class='arch-sketch reveal' style='margin:56px 0 0' aria-label='Sketch of five people standing tall in different rooms they each designed, connected side by side'> <div class='sheet-cap'><span>Elevation C-C</span><span>The Architects</span></div> <svg viewBox='20 140 870 290'> <path class='grnd' d='M30 400 H880'/> <path class='hatch' d='M40 400 l-10 12 M56 400 l-10 12 M72 400 l-10 12 M88 400 l-10 12 M104 400 l-10 12 M120 400 l-10 12 M136 400 l-10 12 M152 400 l-10 12 M168 400 l-10 12 M184 400 l-10 12 M200 400 l-10 12 M216 400 l-10 12 M232 400 l-10 12 M248 400 l-10 12 M264 400 l-10 12 M280 400 l-10 12 M296 400 l-10 12 M312 400 l-10 12 M328 400 l-10 12 M344 400 l-10 12 M360 400 l-10 12 M376 400 l-10 12 M392 400 l-10 12 M408 400 l-10 12 M424 400 l-10 12 M440 400 l-10 12 M456 400 l-10 12 M472 400 l-10 12 M488 400 l-10 12 M504 400 l-10 12 M520 400 l-10 12 M536 400 l-10 12 M552 400 l-10 12 M568 400 l-10 12 M584 400 l-10 12 M600 400 l-10 12 M616 400 l-10 12 M632 400 l-10 12 M648 400 l-10 12 M664 400 l-10 12 M680 400 l-10 12 M696 400 l-10 12 M712 400 l-10 12 M728 400 l-10 12 M744 400 l-10 12 M760 400 l-10 12 M776 400 l-10 12 M792 400 l-10 12 M808 400 l-10 12 M824 400 l-10 12 M840 400 l-10 12 M856 400 l-10 12 M872 400 l-10 12'/> <g class='ar-room' style='transition-delay:0ms'><path d='M40 400 V210 H200 V330 M200 390 V400'/><path class='thin' d='M40 260 h10 v50 h-10'/><circle cx='120' cy='289' r='11'/><path d='M120 300 V358 M120 314 L104 288 M120 314 L136 288 M120 358 L109 400 M120 358 L131 400'/></g> <g class='ar-room' style='transition-delay:180ms'><path d='M200 330 V250 L290 190 L380 250 V330 M380 390 V400'/><path class='thin' d='M325 275 h40 v40 h-40 z M345 275 v40'/><circle cx='290' cy='289' r='11'/><path d='M290 300 V358 M290 314 L275 340 M290 314 L308 290 M290 358 L279 400 M290 358 L301 400'/></g> <g class='ar-room' style='transition-delay:360ms'><path d='M380 330 V170 H500 V330 M500 390 V400'/><path class='thin' d='M405 200 h70 v60 h-70 z'/><circle cx='440' cy='289' r='11'/><path d='M440 300 V358 M440 314 L426 328 L434 340 M440 314 L454 328 L446 340 M440 358 L429 400 M440 358 L451 400'/></g> <g class='ar-room' style='transition-delay:540ms'><path d='M500 330 V230 H690 V330 M690 390 V400'/><path class='thin' d='M560 255 h70 M560 265 h70'/><circle cx='595' cy='289' r='11'/><path d='M595 300 V358 M595 314 L580 340 M595 314 L610 340 M595 358 L584 400 M595 358 L606 400'/></g> <g class='ar-room' style='transition-delay:720ms'><path d='M690 330 V200 Q780 150 870 200 V400'/><path class='thin' d='M812 225 h40 v45 h-40 z'/><circle cx='780' cy='289' r='11'/><path d='M780 300 V358 M780 314 L765 340 M780 314 L806 310 M780 358 L769 400 M780 358 L791 400'/></g> <text x='455' y='160' class='hand c'>every room is different. same work, side by side.</text> </svg> </figure> <div class='midcta reveal'> <a class='btn' href='#included'>Become an Activated Architect <span class='arrow' aria-hidden='true'>&rarr;</span></a> <div class='meta'>Start today. Lifetime access.</div> </div> </div> </section> <section class='included bp' id='included'> <div class='wrap'> <div class='reveal'> <div class='label'>05 &middot; What's included</div> <div class='solves'> <div class='solves-k'>What Wreck the Room solves</div> <p>You built a successful life as someone you never chose to be. It's costing you time you can't get back and money you're leaving on the table. Wreck the Room gives you the full step-by-step system to see the old you, take it apart, and build the you that you'd actually choose.</p> </div> <h2>What you walk away with</h2> <p class='lede'>Not more information. Finished work, in your own handwriting, that changes how you live &amp; how you lead.</p> </div> <div class='walk reveal'> <div class='walk-col'> <div class='walk-k'>Module 01 &middot; Wreck-ognize It</div> <ul> <li>Your room, named and labeled</li> <li>The &ldquo;good&rdquo; values quietly burning you out</li> <li>The lie you've been living, and what triggers it</li> <li>A written design of your new room, before anything comes down</li> </ul> </div> <div class='walk-col'> <div class='walk-k'>Module 02 &middot; Wreck It</div> <ul> <li>An autopilot audit of the patterns running your days</li> <li>The real price of the role you've been playing</li> <li>The unspoken rules and old stories that took your power</li> <li>How to respond on purpose instead of react</li> </ul> </div> <div class='walk-col'> <div class='walk-k'>Module 03 &middot; Wrock It</div> <ul> <li>Your core values and personal standards, written down</li> <li>A calendar that matches who you're becoming</li> <li>Daily rituals and anchors that hold the new you in place</li> <li>A plan for the moment you're tempted back into the old room</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class='fast reveal'> <div class='fast-item'><div class='fast-k'>Week one</div><p>You spot the signs you've been living someone else's design, write your personal manifesto, and name the room you're in.</p></div> <div class='fast-item'><div class='fast-k'>Your pace</div><p>2 to 3 lessons a week, whenever it fits your schedule. At that pace you finish all three modules in about 10 to 14 weeks.</p></div> <div class='fast-item'><div class='fast-k'>Your effort</div><p>Watch the lesson. Do the guided exercises in your workbook. Every step is laid out, so you never have to figure out what's next.</p></div> </div> <div class='reveal' style='margin-top:72px'> <h2>The plans, in full</h2> <p class='lede'>Everything in the Wreck the Room program, with what each piece is worth. Compare it to the cost of another year stuck where you are.</p> </div> <div class='sheet reveal' role='group' aria-label='Wreck the Room contents'> <div class='dims'> <div class='dim'> <div class='dimline' aria-hidden='true'><span class='stop'></span><span class='ln l'></span>A<span class='ln r'></span><span class='stop'></span></div> <div class='n'>27</div> <div class='what'>Video lessons</div> </div> <div class='dim'> <div class='dimline' aria-hidden='true'><span class='stop'></span><span class='ln l'></span>B<span class='ln r'></span><span class='stop'></span></div> <div class='n'>78</div> <div class='what'>Guided exercises &amp; activities</div> </div> <div class='dim'> <div class='dimline' aria-hidden='true'><span class='stop'></span><span class='ln l'></span>A + B<span class='ln r'></span><span class='stop'></span></div> <div class='n'>105</div> <div class='what'>Total learning experiences</div> <div class='sum'>27 + 78 = 105</div> </div> </div> <div class='sov' data-values> <div class='sov-head'><span>Schedule of values</span><span>Value</span></div> <div class='sov-row'><div><b>Module 01: Wreck-ognize It</b><small>10 video lessons with guided exercises. See exactly what you've been living inside, and design what replaces it.</small></div><span class='v'>$12,500</span></div> <div class='sov-row'><div><b>Module 02: Wreck It</b><small>10 video lessons with guided exercises. Break the patterns and roles that keep you safe and small.</small></div><span class='v'>$12,500</span></div> <div class='sov-row'><div><b>Module 03: Wrock It</b><small>7 video lessons with guided exercises. Build your values, standards, calendar and daily rituals around the new you.</small></div><span class='v'>$12,500</span></div> <div class='sov-row'><div><b>Companion workbooks</b><small>78 guided exercises, so the work gets done on paper, not just understood.</small></div><span class='v'>$4,500</span></div> <div class='sov-row'><div><b>Architects community and the Wrecking Crew</b><small>Do the work alongside other people going through the program, and the founding members who went first.</small></div><span class='v'>$5,000</span></div> <div class='sov-row'><div><b>Lifetime access</b><small>Every lesson and exercise, for as long as you want them.</small></div><span class='v'>$3,000</span></div> <div class='sov-total'><span>Total value</span><span class='v'>$50,000</span></div> <div class='sov-yours'><span>Launch pricing from</span><span class='v'>$3,500</span></div> <div class='sov-note'>Every option includes everything above. Pick how much support you want from Jody below.</div> </div> <div class='titleblock'> <div>Project<b>Wreck the Room</b></div> <div>Sheet<b>A-01</b></div> <div>Phase<b>Design</b></div> <div>Architect<b>You</b></div> </div> </div> <div class='midcta reveal'> <a class='btn' href='#enroll'>See your options <span class='arrow' aria-hidden='true'>&rarr;</span></a> <div class='meta'>$50,000 in value, launch pricing from $3,500</div> </div> </div> </section> <section class='fit bp' id='fit'> <div class='wrap'> <div class='reveal'> <div class='label'>06 &middot; Fit</div> <h2>Read this part twice</h2> <p class='lede'>Wreck the Room works for a specific kind of person. Here's how to tell if that's you.</p> </div> <div class='deepwork reveal'> <h3>Done the retreats. Hired the mindset coach. Finished the training. <span>Nothing stuck.</span></h3> <p>That's not because you didn't try hard enough. Those made you better at being who you've been. Who you actually are never got a say, so the old pattern kept coming back. Wreck the Room was built for the deep work underneath.</p> </div> <div class='fit-grid reveal'> <div class='fit-col fit-for sheet-card'><span class='tick tl'></span><span class='tick br'></span> <h3>You, if <span class='stamp'>Approved</span></h3> <ul> <li>You've built something real, and something still feels off.</li> <li>You look successful on the outside, but you feel disconnected on the inside.</li> <li>You've hired mindset coaches, done the retreats, maybe done therapy. Some of it helped, and you still hit the same wall.</li> <li>You're tired of quick fixes and want change that lasts.</li> <li>You're willing to look at where your patterns came from, not just manage them.</li> <li>You're ready to do the work, not just learn about it.</li> </ul> </div> <div class='fit-col fit-not sheet-card'><span class='tick tl'></span><span class='tick br'></span> <h3>Not you, if <span class='stamp'>Redlined</span></h3> <ul> <li>You're looking for tactics, scripts or a quick fix.<small>This is deep work. It takes time.</small></li> <li>You're not ready to be honest with yourself on paper, on your own.</li> <li>You want someone else to do the work for you.<small>Jody guides you. You do the rebuilding.</small></li> <li>You're in crisis or working through trauma right now.<small>Start with a licensed therapist. Wreck the Room will be here.</small></li> </ul> </div> </div> <p class='fit-note reveal'>If the red list sounds like you, Wreck the Room isn't the right fit right now. If the &ldquo;Approved&rdquo; list does, pick the level of support below that matches how you work best. Somewhere in between? <a href='https://calendly.com/jody_friedman/45-minute-strategy-call' data-link='call' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Book a strategy call</a> and ask Jody straight.</p> </div> </section> <section class='proof bp' id='proof'> <div class='wrap'> <div class='reveal'> <div class='label'>07 &middot; From Architects</div> <h2>In their words</h2> </div> <div class='proof-grid reveal'> <figure class='tcard'> <span class='qmark' aria-hidden='true'>&ldquo;</span> <blockquote> <p class='t-head'>Jody's framework doesn't just focus on changing behaviors. It helps you understand the identity underneath.</p> <p>When I came into this course, I thought it would be about working through things from my past. What I've really discovered is that I have begun to create a new blueprint for my future.</p> <p>Naming my room was a real turning point. It wasn't about blaming my past. It was about understanding where those patterns came from, and realizing that I had the freedom to choose differently.</p> </blockquote> <figcaption class='who'><div class='avatar'>AP</div><div><b>Amara P.</b><span>Business owner</span></div></figcaption> </figure> <figure class='tcard'> <span class='qmark' aria-hidden='true'>&ldquo;</span> <blockquote> <p class='t-head'>Jody's authenticity reflected back to me exactly where I want to be.</p> <p>It was so validating to hear Jody's story, and to hear how we can be who we are.</p> <p>I have a tendency to build my room and then quickly want to go to the next. Celebrating being in the room I built for a while is super important. It helps me really connect more to who I am. I do not believe I can do this alone. So grateful.</p> </blockquote> <figcaption class='who'><div class='avatar'>CB</div><div><b>Christy B.</b><span>Realtor and business owner</span></div></figcaption> </figure> <figure class='tcard'> <span class='qmark' aria-hidden='true'>&ldquo;</span> <blockquote> <p class='t-head'>A lot of the smaller changes I'd made after being stuck were just minor renovations.</p> <p>Over the last 3 years, I've changed countries and careers. Jody's framework really helped me name where I'm at in that process.</p> <p>Now I'm looking forward to a big rebuild, and being intentional with my design instead of letting things happen to me and making minor course corrections.</p> </blockquote> <figcaption class='who'><div class='avatar'>JD</div><div><b>Jeremy D.</b><span>Small business owner</span></div></figcaption> </figure> <figure class='tcard'> <span class='qmark' aria-hidden='true'>&ldquo;</span> <blockquote> <p class='t-head'>I took my first vacation in six years. I'm already planning the second one.</p> <p>I didn't see how much of my life I'd spent waiting for permission. Wrecking that room is what finally let me rest without guilt.</p> <p>It also took care of the thing I was most afraid of: sales. Once I stopped waiting for permission, I started asking for the business. Since then, our revenue has grown 10x.</p> </blockquote> <figcaption class='who'><div class='avatar'>RE</div><div><b>Robert E.</b><span>Marketing team leader</span></div></figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </section> <style>.t-launch{font-family:var(--caps);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--red-hi);margin:18px 0 -6px}.t-launch s{color:#5b5f68;margin-left:8px;font-size:15px;text-decoration-color:var(--red-hi);text-decoration-thickness:2px}</style><section class='price bp' id='enroll'> <div class='wrap'> <div class='price-head reveal'> <div class='label'>08 &middot; Choose your path</div> <h2>Same program. Your level of support.</h2> <p class='lede' style='margin:0 auto'>Consider for a moment another year in a life that doesn't feel like yours. Income stuck at the level your old self feels safe with. More money on coaches, courses and fixes that wear off. Every option below is built to end that. The only difference is how much of Jody you get along the way.</p> </div> <div class='equation reveal'> <div><span>The result</span>A life and business that finally feel like yours</div> <div><span>The path</span>Wreck-ognize It, Wreck It, Wrock It, in that order</div> <div><span>How fast</span>You name your room in week one</div> <div><span>How hard</span>2 to 3 lessons a week, every step laid out</div> </div> <div class='tiers reveal'> <article class='tier-card'> <div class='t-name'>Blueprint</div> <div class='t-kind'>Self-guided</div> <div class='t-best'>Best if you finish what you start on your own.</div> <div class='t-cost'><b>The cost it ends:</b> paying for the next coach, course or retreat that sits on top of the old you.</div> <div class='t-launch'>Launch pricing <s>$5,000</s></div><div class='t-price'><span>$</span>3,500</div> <div class='t-plan'>or 2 monthly payments of $1,877</div> <ul> <li>The full Wreck the Room program: 27 video lessons and 78 guided exercises</li> <li>Companion workbooks</li> <li>Architects community and the Wrecking Crew</li> <li>Lifetime access</li> </ul> <div class='t-addon'><b>Optional at checkout, +$2,000:</b> three 1:1 alignment coaching sessions with Jody, at the beginning, middle and end.</div> <a class='btn' id='buyBtn' href='#'>Start Blueprint <span class='arrow' aria-hidden='true'>&rarr;</span></a> <div class='t-note'>Instant access. Choose pay-in-full or the payment plan at checkout.</div> </article> <article class='tier-card featured'> <div class='t-flag'>Recommended</div> <div class='t-name'>Council</div> <div class='t-kind'>Small-group coaching with Jody</div> <div class='t-best'>Best if you want accountability and people doing the work beside you.</div> <div class='t-cost'><b>The cost it ends:</b> another year stuck in the same pattern. Fourteen weeks, a small group and Jody make sure this year isn't one of those.</div> <div class='t-launch'>Launch pricing <s>$15,000</s></div><div class='t-price'><span>$</span>5,000</div> <div class='t-plan'>or 2 monthly payments of $2,650</div> <div class='t-scarce'>Only 4 Councils a year &middot; 6 to 8 people each</div> <ul> <li><b>Everything in Blueprint</b></li> <li>14 weeks with Jody and your Council</li> <li>7 live group coaching calls, including graduation</li> <li>3 private 1:1 strategy sessions with Jody</li> <li>E.L.E.V.A.T.E. Identity Calibration System: your insurance for when you need to recalibrate<small class='t-sub'>7 extra lessons you can come back to any time life shifts, so you can check who you're being and get back to your design without starting over.</small></li> <li>34 lessons and 140+ learning experiences in all</li> </ul> <a class='btn' href='https://calendly.com/jody_friedman/council-application-call-council' data-link='council-apply' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Apply for Council <span class='arrow' aria-hidden='true'>&rarr;</span></a> <div class='t-note'>Starts with a strategy call with Jody to make sure it's the right fit.</div> </article> <article class='tier-card'> <div class='t-name'>Inner Circle</div> <div class='t-kind'>Private 1:1 coaching with Jody</div> <div class='t-best'>Best if you want Jody in your corner, one on one.</div> <div class='t-cost'><b>The cost it ends:</b> the big moves you keep not making. Jody is beside you while you make them.</div> <div class='t-launch'>Launch pricing <s>$25,000</s></div><div class='t-price'><span>$</span>20,000</div> <div class='t-plan'>or 2 monthly payments of $10,500</div> <ul> <li><b>Everything in Blueprint</b></li> <li>Six months of private 1:1 coaching with Jody</li> <li>Bi-weekly 1:1 meetings with Jody, so you have time to complete the exercises between sessions</li> <li>Private 1:1 sessions with Jody whenever you need them</li> <li>Direct access to Jody on Voxer, Monday to Friday, 9 to 5</li> <li>E.L.E.V.A.T.E. Identity Calibration System: your insurance for when you need to recalibrate<small class='t-sub'>7 extra lessons you can come back to any time life shifts, so you can check who you're being and get back to your design without starting over.</small></li> <li>34 lessons and 140+ learning experiences in all</li> </ul> <a class='btn btn-ghost' href='https://calendly.com/jody_friedman/45-minute-strategy-call' data-link='call' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Apply for Inner Circle <span class='arrow' aria-hidden='true'>&rarr;</span></a> <div class='t-note'>Starts with a strategy call with Jody to make sure it's the right fit.</div> </article> </div> <div class='guarantee reveal'> <div class='g-seal' aria-hidden='true'><svg viewBox='0 0 100 100'><circle cx='50' cy='50' r='44'/><circle cx='50' cy='50' r='37'/><path d='M34 51 L45 62 L67 39'/></svg></div> <div> <div class='g-k'>The Do-the-Work Guarantee</div> <h3>&ldquo;What if I do the work and nothing changes?&rdquo; Then Jody keeps working with you.</h3> <p>You've paid for things that didn't stick before, so here's the deal. Complete every single lesson and show up to every call. If you don't see any change, here's what happens:</p> <ul> <li><b>Blueprint:</b> finish all 27 lessons and you get a free 1:1 session with Jody to get you unstuck.</li> <li><b>Council:</b> join the next Council free.</li> <li><b>Inner Circle:</b> Jody coaches you for an extra month, at no charge.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class='terms-wide reveal'> <h4>Refund policy</h4> <p>Every option is non-refundable, and the guarantee above is how we stand behind it. A refund pays you to stop halfway. The guarantee pays you to finish, because finishing is what changes you. All sales are final, including the Blueprint coaching add-on. That's why Council and Inner Circle start with a strategy call, and why the red &ldquo;Not you&rdquo; list is above. Make sure this is right for you before you join.</p> </div> </div> </section> <section class='faq bp' id='faq'> <div class='wrap'> <div class='reveal'> <div class='label'>09 &middot; General notes</div> <h2>Questions before you build</h2> </div> <ol class='notes reveal'> <li><details><summary>I've already done coaching, retreats and maybe therapy. Why would this be different?</summary><p>Most of that work helped you understand a pattern or manage it. The pattern came back because the identity underneath it, the version of you that needed it to feel safe, never changed. Wreck the Room goes after that identity, in order: Wreck-ognize It, Wreck It, Wrock It. If you keep hitting the same wall, that's usually the missing piece.</p></details></li> <li><details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. Therapy often focuses on understanding and healing what happened. Wreck the Room is about what you build next: who you choose to be, written down and put into your calendar and your decisions. Plenty of people do both. It isn't a substitute for therapy or for medical or mental health care. If you're in crisis or working through trauma, please work with a licensed professional first.</p></details></li> <li><details><summary>Is this just mindset work in nicer packaging?</summary><p>Mindset work changes how you think about the room. This changes the room. You finish with things you can hold: your values and standards written down, a calendar that matches them, and a plan for the moment you get pulled back. That's 78 guided exercises done on paper, not just watched.</p></details></li> <li><details><summary>How do I know this won't wear off like everything else?</summary><p>Change wears off when it sits on top of the old you. Here the old you comes down first, and Wrock It ends by locking in the new you with daily rituals and a plan for when you're tempted back. You keep lifetime access, so you can run it again whenever life changes. Council and Inner Circle also include the E.L.E.V.A.T.E. Identity Calibration System: 7 extra lessons you can come back to any time life shifts, so you can check who you're being and get back to your design without starting over.</p></details></li> <li><details><summary>Will wrecking the room blow up my business or my relationships?</summary><p>No. You wreck the room, not your life. In Wreck-ognize It you design the new room on paper before anything comes down, so you decide what stays. What changes is how you show up inside the life you already built.</p></details></li> <li><details><summary>What if I do the work and nothing changes?</summary><p>That's what the Do-the-Work Guarantee is for. Complete every lesson and show up to every call. If you don't see any change, Jody keeps working with you: a free 1:1 session on Blueprint, the next Council free on Council, or an extra month of coaching on Inner Circle.</p></details></li> <li><details><summary>Is $3,500 to $20,000 really worth it for personal growth?</summary><p>Consider for a moment what the last few coaches, courses and retreats cost you. Then add another year of income stuck where your old self feels safe, and another year in the same pattern. Wreck the Room isn't one more of those. It's the work that goes under them, so you're not back here next year buying the next one.</p></details></li> <li><details><summary>I'm a leader inside a company, not a founder. Is this for me?</summary><p>Yes. The room is the same either way: the roles and unspoken rules you've been running on. The work applies whether you own the business or lead a team inside one.</p></details></li> <li><details><summary>I don't have much time. Can I actually do this?</summary><p>You set the pace. There are 27 video lessons and 78 guided exercises, and you have lifetime access, so you can work through it on your own schedule. Then compare that to the time your old patterns already cost you every week.</p></details></li> <li><details><summary>What if I choose Blueprint and get stuck on my own?</summary><p>You'll have the Architects community and the Wrecking Crew. You can also add three 1:1 alignment coaching sessions with Jody at checkout for $2,000: one at the beginning, one in the middle and one at the end. If you already know you don't finish things alone, that's what Council is for.</p></details></li> <li><details><summary>Which option is right for me?</summary><p>If you finish what you start on your own, Blueprint. If you want accountability and a small group doing the work beside you, Council. If you want Jody one on one for six months, with private sessions whenever you need them and direct access on Voxer, Inner Circle. Not sure? <a href='https://calendly.com/jody_friedman/45-minute-strategy-call' data-link='call' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Book a strategy call</a> and figure it out together.</p></details></li> <li><details><summary>Is there a payment plan?</summary><p>Yes, on every option. At launch pricing: Blueprint is $3,500, or 2 monthly payments of $1,877. Council is $5,000, or 2 monthly payments of $2,650. Inner Circle is $20,000, or 2 monthly payments of $10,500.</p></details></li> <li><details><summary>Can I get a refund?</summary><p>No. Every option is non-refundable and all sales are final, including the Blueprint coaching add-on. Instead, there's the Do-the-Work Guarantee: complete every lesson and show up to every call, and if you don't see any change, Jody keeps working with you. Read the red &ldquo;Not you&rdquo; list above, and if you're unsure which option fits, <a href='https://calendly.com/jody_friedman/45-minute-strategy-call' data-link='call' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>book a strategy call</a> first.</p></details></li> </ol> </div> </section> <svg class='drafting-mark scalebar' viewBox='0 0 220 40' fill='none' stroke='#F4F4F4' stroke-width='1.2' aria-hidden='true'> <path d='M10 22 H210'/><path d='M10 16 V28 M60 16 V28 M110 16 V28 M160 16 V28 M210 16 V28'/> <rect x='10' y='19' width='50' height='6' fill='#F4F4F4' fill-opacity='.8' stroke='none'/><rect x='110' y='19' width='50' height='6' fill='#F4F4F4' fill-opacity='.8' stroke='none'/> <text x='10' y='40' fill='#F4F4F4' stroke='none' font-family='Architects Daughter, cursive' font-size='11'>0</text> <text x='210' y='40' text-anchor='end' fill='#F4F4F4' stroke='none' font-family='Architects Daughter, cursive' font-size='11'>SCALE</text> </svg> </div>";var s=document.currentScript;if(document.readyState==='loading'){document.write(h);}else if(s){var r=document.createRange();r.selectNode(s);s.parentNode.insertBefore(r.createContextualFragment(h),s.nextSibling);}})();
